    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Horror game that takes place in the early 80's. You get in a accident due to drinking and driving, and wake up in a forest near Cedarvale, Texas. The walk to town is far, so you must find a way out of the forest and survive. Something lurking wants to stop you from doing so. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >search the forest for things that could help to escape. Dont get caught by the creature lurking. Good Luck.</p>",
